  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "すまんなぁ、ポスター貼りまで手伝ってもらって。\nでも、おかげで話題になっとるよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "老店主"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "大会はまだ少し先だが、お店に来てくれる子も\n増えたし……何だかもう、満足した気持ちだよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "老店主"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "何言ってんの、本番はこれからでしょ。\n俺たち、イベントを大成功させる自信があるからね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そうだよ、おじーちゃん。\n当日を楽しみに待ってて？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "花園 百々人"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……秀、百々人。少しいいか。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "眉見 鋭心"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-18:text",
        "step_id": 18,
        "step_index": 17,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 17
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "大会の宣伝なんだが、\n俺たちだからこそ出来ることがある。……例えば。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "眉見 鋭心"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-22:text",
        "step_id": 22,
        "step_index": 21,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 21
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "身内にも協力を求めてみないか？\n俺は明日、朝礼で全校生徒に呼び掛けるつもりだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "眉見 鋭心"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ふふ、生徒会長特権だね。それじゃ僕も、\n学校のみんなにお願いしてみようかなあ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "花園 百々人"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "頼む。権力の濫用は褒められた行為じゃないが、\n今はそれ以上に、あの店主の夢を叶えたいからな。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "眉見 鋭心"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-26:text",
        "step_id": 26,
        "step_index": 25,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 25
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（……どうしよ。俺、学校のみんなと\nそんなに仲良くないんだけど）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-29:text",
        "step_id": 29,
        "step_index": 28,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 28
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "source_text": "秀の自室",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "none",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": ""
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-36:caption",
        "step_id": 36,
        "step_index": 35,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 35
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "……そういや、クラスの奴に誘われて入った\nチャットグループがあったっけ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-38:text",
        "step_id": 38,
        "step_index": 37,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 37
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（ずっと放置してたけど、そこで宣伝してみるか。\nこんな感じで……よし、少しは反応あるだろ）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-40:text",
        "step_id": 40,
        "step_index": 39,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 39
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いや、でもな……これが初めてのメッセージだし、\n俺からだって気づかれない可能性も……って、うわ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-42:text",
        "step_id": 42,
        "step_index": 41,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 41
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（すごい勢いで返信がきてる。\n「やっと連絡くれた！」「絶対行く！」だって）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-45:text",
        "step_id": 45,
        "step_index": 44,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 44
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ったく。みんな、俺のこと好きすぎでしょ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_02_h:step-47:text",
        "step_id": 47,
        "step_index": 46,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_02_h",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_02_h.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 49,
          "target_step_index": 46
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（……なぁ、親友。\nお前も、反応くらいしてくれよな）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "天峰 秀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
